    +PropertyMetadata--YDF_DK(
      $projectBuildingCommonSettingsSpecification.$selectiveExecutions.value.properties.$processingOnDemand
    )

    p.Article-Paragraph
      | Relates to the
      |
      +Keyword--YDID optimization
      |
      | functionality of the
      |
      +Link--YDF({
        internalURI: localizedRouting.functionality.$children.markupProcessing.$children.optimization.$URI
      }) markup processing on demand
      | , and also to the
      |
      +Link--YDF({
        internalURI: localizedRouting.functionality.$children.browserLiveReloading.$URI
      }) browser live reloading
      | . Therefore, this group of settings is relevant #[+Keyword--YDID only] for #[+Keyword__Contrast--YDID incremental]
      |
      +Link--YDF({
        internalURI: localizedRouting.terminology.$sectioning.projectBuildingMode.$URI
      }) project building modes
      | .

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      #[+Keyphrase--YDID By default], when saving #[+Keyword--YDID changed] #[+Keyword__Contrast--YDID source]
        #[+Term--YDID markup] files, #[+ImportantEntity--YDID YDA] processes #[+Keyword--YDID only] those
        #[+Term--YDID entry points] that are related to these files via #[+Term--YDID Pug directives]
        #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID include] and #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID extends].
      However, in many cases, this optimization measure may&nbsp;not be enough to prevent the rebuilding of several dozen
        #[+Term--YDID entry points] after editing one or two #[+Term--YDID Pug files], which can hinder productive
        development.
      In this case, you can activate the optimization mode where only the #[+Term--YDID entry point] corresponding to the
        page open in the browser is processed.

    +AdmonitionBlock--YDF({
      SVG_Icon: true,
      geometricVariation: AdmonitionBlock__YDF.GeometricVariations.stickyNoteLike,
      decorativeVariation: AdmonitionBlock__YDF.DecorativeVariations.warning
    }).
      If you are going to show a #[+Term--YDID static preview] to a client, then before sending the files, restart the
        project building either with #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID $processingOnDemand] #[+Keyword--YDID temporarily]
        disabled, or set #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID true] value to #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID $fullInitialBuilding]
        #[+Term--YDID option], otherwise some #[+Term--YDID HTML files] may be outdated.

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      This section discusses the #[+Term--YDID processing on demand] settings
