    p.Article-Paragraph.
      If has been set with #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID true], then the #[+Term--YDID processing on demand] mode will be
        enabled.
      If you want this mode to be disabled, you can explicitly specify #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID false],
        but it is the #[+Keyphrase--YDID default] value.


    //- ┄┄┄ `$fullInitialBuilding` — Whether full initial building is required ┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄
