    +PropertyMetadata--YDF_DK(
      $projectBuildingCommonSettingsSpecification.$selectiveExecutions.value.properties.$processingOnDemand.properties.
          $fullInitialBuilding
    )

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      If the value is #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID true], then during the #[+Keyword--YDID initial]
        #[+Term--YDID project build] process, #[+Keyword--YDID all] #[+Term--YDID entry points] relevant to the current
        #[+Term--YDID selective execution] will be processed, which may take some time if you have several dozen
        #[+Term--YDID entry points].
      The #[+Keyword--YDID default] value is #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID false]; in this case, a specific
        #[+Term--YDID Pug file] will be processed #[+Keyword--YDID only] when its corresponding #[+Term--YDID HTML file]
        is opened in the browser, which, although #[+Keyword--YDID not] instantaneous, usually takes about
        #[+ImportantEntity--YDID 2-3 seconds].


