    )

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      The names of #[+Keyword--YDID directories] that will be #[+Keyword--YDID excluded] from the watching regardless
        of the depth at which they are located and which specific #[+Keyword--YDID incremental]
        #[+Term--YDID building mode] is running.
      Here usually it makes sense to exclude directories for #[+Keyword--YDID production-like] #[+Term--YDID project builds].


    //- ╍╍╍ `buildingModeDependent` — Building Mode Dependent ╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍
    +Heading--YDF({
