    +PropertyMetadata--YDF_DK(
      $projectBuildingCommonSettingsSpecification.$filesWatching.properties.$buildingModeDependent.value.properties.
          $excludeFilesWithPathsRelativeToProjectRootDirectory
    )

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      The names of #[+Keyword--YDID files] that will be #[+Keyword--YDID excluded] regardless of the depth at which they
        are located, but
        #[+Keyphrase--YDID #[+Keyword--YDID only] for the #[+Keyword__Contrast--YDID specified] #[+Term--YDID building mode]].


    //- ─── `excludeDirectoriesWithPathsRelativeToProjectRootDirectory` — Relative Paths of Excluded Directories ───────
    +Heading--YDF({
      level: 4,
      innerHTML: localizedSectioning.filesWatching.$children.buildingModeDependent.$children.
          excludeDirectoriesWithPathsRelativeToProjectRootDirectory.$heading,
      HTML_ID: localizedSectioning.filesWatching.$children.buildingModeDependent.$children.
          excludeDirectoriesWithPathsRelativeToProjectRootDirectory.$anchor
    }).Article-Heading4

    +PropertyMetadata--YDF_DK(
      $projectBuildingCommonSettingsSpecification.$filesWatching.properties.$buildingModeDependent.value.properties.
          $excludeDirectoriesWithPathsRelativeToProjectRootDirectory
    )

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      The names of #[+Keyword--YDID directories] that will be #[+Keyword--YDID excluded] regardless of the depth at which
        they are located, but
        #[+Keyphrase--YDID #[+Keyword--YDID only] for the #[+Keyword__Contrast--YDID specified] #[+Term--YDID building mode]].

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      Consider the following example:

    +CodeViewer--YDF
      +CodeViewer-Listing--YDF({ codeLanguage: CodeViewer__YDF.SupportedCodesLanguages.YAML }).

        $projectBuilding:

          $commonSettings:

            #...

            $filesWatching:

              $excludeFilesWithPathsRelativeToProjectRootDirectory:

                - TestingBuild
                - StagingBuild
                - ProductionBuild

              $buildingModeDependent:

                $staticPreview:

                  $excludeFilesWithPathsRelativeToProjectRootDirectory:

                    - LocalDevelopmentBuild

                $localDevelopment:

                  $excludeFilesWithPathsRelativeToProjectRootDirectory:

                    - StaticPreviewBuild

    ul.Article-UnorderedList

      li.
        The #[+SecondaryEntity--YDID TestingBuild], #[+SecondaryEntity--YDID StagingBuild], and
          #[+SecondaryEntity--YDID ProductionBuild] directories contain #[+Term--YDID builds] for the corresponding
          #[+Keyword--YDID production-like] #[+Term--YDID modes].
        Usually, there is no&nbsp;need to watch these directories, so they are #[+Keyword--YDID completely]
          #[+Keyword__Contrast--YDID ignored].

      li.
        For the static preview #[+Term--YDID building mode] case, there is no point in watching the #[+Term--YDID build]
          for the local development #[+Term--YDID mode], so for static preview #[+Term--YDID building mode]
           #[+SecondaryEntity--YDID LocalDevelopmentBuild] directory is ignored.
        Note that if we also ignore #[+SecondaryEntity--YDID StaticPreviewBuild] here, the browser page live
          reloading will&nbsp;#[+Keyword--YDID not] occur, since it is performed when the status of build files changes.

      li.
        For the "local development" #[+Term--YDID building mode], #[+Keyword--YDID conversely], there is no point in watching
          the #[+Term--YDID build] for the static preview #[+Term--YDID mode], so the
          #[+SecondaryEntity--YDID StaticPreviewBuild] directory is #[+Keyword--YDID ignored].
